'''Hillsville''' is a town located in [[Carroll County, Virginia]], [[United States|USA]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 2,607.  It is the [[county seat]] of [[Carroll County, Virginia|Carroll County]]{{GR|6}}.

== Geography ==
