      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Boyce''' is a town located in [[Clarke County, Virginia]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the town had a total population of 426.

== Geography ==
[[Image:VAMap-doton-Boyce.PNG|right|Location of Boyce, Virginia]]
