There are 17,789 households, out of which 41.5% have children under the age of 18 living with them, 54.0% are [[Marriage|married couples]] living together, 10.4% have a female householder with no husband present, and 32.0% are non-families. 21.5% of all households are made up of individuals and 2.1% have someone living alone who is 65 years of age or older.  The average household size is 2.74 and the average family size is 3.27.

In the CDP, the population is spread out, with 28.4% under the age of 18, 8.2% from 18 to 24, 43.7% from 25 to 44, 16.4% from 45 to 64, and 3.3% who are 65 years of age or older.  The median age is 31 years.  For every 100 females, there are 97.6 males.  For every 100 females age 18 and over, there are 94.6 males.

