      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Chantilly''' is an [[unincorporated community]] located in western [[Fairfax County, Virginia]].  Part of the Chantilly mailing address is also in eastern [[Loudoun County]], with most residents in the [[South Riding, Virginia|South Riding]] community.  Recognized by the U.S. Census Bureau as a [[census designated place]] (CDP), the community had a total population of 41,041 as of the [[2000]] census. It is named after the [[Chantilly, Oise|town of the same]] name in [[France]].

Miles to DC: 24.2  

