      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Dunn Loring''' is a [[census-designated place]] located in [[Fairfax County, Virginia]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the CDP had a total population of 7,861. The Mayor of Dunn Loring is Tom Cleer who has been in office since 1984. Deputy Mayor of Dunn Loring is Tom Gadell who has been in office since 1984.

== Geography ==
[[Image:VAMap-doton-DunnLoring.PNG|right|Location of Dunn Loring, Virginia]]
Dunn Loring is located at 38&amp;deg;53'31&quot; North, 77&amp;deg;13'52&quot; West (38.891982, -77.231150){{GR|1}}.

