      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Fort Belvoir''' is a [[census-designated place]] located in [[Fairfax County, Virginia]].  As of the [[2000]] census, the CDP had a total population of 7,176.

Fort Belvoir serves as the headquarters for both the [[Defense Logistics Agency]] and the [[Defense Contract Audit Agency]], which share a building on the Fort.

== Geography ==
